# An element may have an unconditional block (invariants, before the first
# When:) followed by condition blocks. The unconditional block and the
# condition blocks assert different targets.
Screen: Order Details

  Element: Order Summary
    Show: Order number
    And: Order date
    And: Total amount

    When: The order has shipped
    Show: Tracking number
    Hide: Cancel link

    When: The order has not shipped
    Show: Cancel link
    Hide: Tracking number

  Element: Cancel Button
    Show: Cancel label

    When: The order has not shipped
    Enable

    When: The order has shipped
    Disable
